      "writtenOn": "2015-11-11T17:27:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "KeyStore can contain three types of entries: secret key, private key + cert chain, trusted (CA) cert. getCertificate returns a non-null cert for the two latter entry types. However, you code here must only include trusted (CA) certs and thus must ignore the private key + cert chain entries.\n\nTo fix this, you can filter using KeyStore.isCertificateEntry(alias) or KeyStore.getEntry and then instanceof KeyStore.TrustedCertificateEntry.",
      "revId": "a8bf943a700b8f98cbd79dec7beb187f830523eb",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": false
